## File formats & limits

| | |
|---|---|
| **Accepted input** | Any image the browser can decode — **PNG or JPG** recommended (the file picker uses `image/*`). Drag-and-drop or click to load; **multiple files** at once are fine. |
| **Loaded as** | Data URLs (sandbox-safe, no cross-origin issues) — so it works fully offline. |
| **Max scan size** | Very large scans work (the reference sheet is **8000×1550**). The auto-detect analyzes a downscaled copy so big scans don't hit canvas limits. Note: extremely wide scans display in the source view as a **short strip** — croppable, just small. |
| **Source view** | Fit to ~480×360, aspect preserved. |
| **Output** | Fixed **256×256 transparent PNG**, plus a code snippet for the game. |

